{'symbol': 'IR', 'date': '2023-04-11 16:16:00', 'title': 'INGERSOLL RAND NAMES ENRIQUE MINARRO VISERAS SENIOR VICE PRESIDENT AND GENERAL MANAGER, GLOBAL PRECISION & SCIENCE TECHNOLOGIES', 'text': 'DAVIDSON, N.C.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--INGERSOLL RAND INC. (NYSE: IR) HAS APPOINTED ENRIQUE MINARRO VISERAS AS ITS SENIOR VICE PRESIDENT AND GENERAL MANAGER OF THE GLOBAL PRECISION & SCIENCE TECHNOLOGIES (PST) SEGMENT, REPORTING TO VICENTE REYNAL, CHAIRMAN, PRESIDENT AND CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER.'}